<body data-page="08">
  <nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习站导航"></nav>
  <main class="page page--wide">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">08 · 折叠快路</p>
      <h1>folded 不是第四种算法，而是覆盖普通主链的执行位置优化</h1>
      <p class="lead">Draft proposal folded、Target folded accept、optional folded commit 是三层独立能力。前一层成立不推出后一层；任一 guard 失败都必须回到普通实现并汇入同一个可观察结果。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>后端边界</strong> 当前 <code>DsparkVerifyEpilogue</code> 仅 NVIDIA CUDA</span><span><strong>共同合同</strong> <code>AcceptOuts → next_draft_input → GenerationBatchResult</code></span><span><strong>证据范围</strong> 静态源码；未执行 CUDA Graph 回放</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择讲解路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>
    <section class="handoff" aria-label="本页边界">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span>03 的 <code>proposal.folded</code>、05 的 compact/graph 结果、06/07 的普通尾部合同</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>本页判断</b><span><code>fold_eligible → folded_accept → folded_commit</code> 三层 guard</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span>快路或 fallback 均得到同一 <code>AcceptOuts</code> 与下一轮状态</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>不负责</b><span>接受数学见 06/06A；物理 compact rows 见 05；KV/anchor 合同见 07</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="folded-overlay">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 普通主链与折叠覆盖层</p><h2>紫色层只替换执行位置，绿色主链永远是语义基准</h2></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="7">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>三个 folded 层级 + 七道运行时门</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#overlay-map">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status></div></div>
        <div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="overlay-map" id="overlay-map" aria-label="普通 dSpark 主链与三层 folded 覆盖架构图">
          <article class="fold-layer fold-draft" data-routes="folded-greedy" data-step-node="0"><b>self._draft_sampler : DsparkDraftSampler</b><span>Draft CUDA graph tail：greedy Markov sampler；令 <code>proposal.folded=True</code>。它不以 verify epilogue 存在为前提。</span></article>
          <article class="fold-layer fold-accept" data-routes="folded-greedy" data-step-node="4"><b>self._verify_epilogue : DsparkVerifyEpilogue</b><span>Target compact graph 尾部：scatter → greedy accept → finalize → BuildOutTokens。</span></article>
          <article class="fold-layer fold-commit" data-routes="folded-greedy" data-step-node="6"><b>可选 fused commit</b><span>只有 KV pool 提供融合写接口时，hidden/KV commit 才一并折叠。</span></article>
          <div class="normal-chain">
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="0"><b>03 · Draft proposal</b><span>普通 Draft transformer + Markov sampler</span></article>
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="2"><b>04/05 · layout + Target</b><span>compact 或 non-compact；graph 或 eager</span></article>
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="3"><b>05 · scatter</b><span>compact logits/hidden → fixed stride</span></article>
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="4"><b>06 · accept/finalize</b><span>greedy / sampling / mixed</span></article>
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="5"><b>07 · hidden/KV commit</b><span>受 <code>commit_lens</code> 约束</span></article>
            <article class="normal-node" data-step-node="6"><b>共同尾部</b><span><code>next_draft_input</code> + <code>GenerationBatchResult</code></span></article>
          </div>
        </div></div>
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>Guard 电路 · 每个“否”都标出准确 fallback</strong></div>
        <div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="guard-circuit" aria-label="folded accept 与 commit guard 电路">
          <article class="guard-gate" data-step-node="0"><b>proposal.folded？</b><span>draft sampler 存在、Draft forward 实际走 graph、整批 all-greedy；这条 Draft 能力独立判断</span><em>否：Draft proposal 回普通 sampler；Target 仍按自己的条件执行</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-kind="cuda" data-step-node="1"><b>verify epilogue 存在？</b><span><code>compact &amp;&amp; !disable_cuda_graph &amp;&amp; is_cuda()</code></span><em>否：Target scatter/accept/commit 普通；Draft proposal 仍可能 folded</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-step-node="2"><b>语义可等价？</b><span>verify logits adjustment 为 noop、未模拟接受、无 grammar</span><em>否：即使图内算过也不采用 accept buffer</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-step-node="3"><b>run_compact？</b><span><code>mode=COMPACT &amp;&amp; layout!=None</code></span><em>否：完整 Target + 普通接受</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-kind="cuda" data-step-node="4"><b>本轮 Target 图命中？</b><span><code>target_verify.can_run_cuda_graph</code></span><em>否：eager / 显式 scatter / 普通接受</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-kind="main" data-step-node="5"><b>folded_accept</b><span>前述条件全部为真，才 <code>read_accept(bs)</code></span><em>否则回到 06 并重新汇合</em></article>
          <article class="guard-gate" data-kind="cuda" data-step-node="6"><b>pool 可 fused 写？</b><span><code>epilogue.folds_commit</code></span><em>否：accept 已 folded，commit_hidden 仍在图外</em></article>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="routes-and-trust">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 路线与信任边界</p><h2>“图里执行过”不等于“Worker 会采用”</h2></div>
      <div class="route-matrix">
        <article class="route-card" data-routes="static-greedy"><b>STATIC · 贪心</b><span><code>layout=None</code>，不 compact；proposal 可能折叠，但 Target folded accept 不成立。</span></article>
        <article class="route-card" data-routes="compact-sampling"><b>COMPACT · 随机采样</b><span>Target 可以 compact/graph；sampling 令 <code>proposal.folded=false</code>，接受仍在 graph 外按真实 p/q 修正。</span></article>
        <article class="route-card" data-routes="folded-greedy"><b>FOLDED · 贪心</b><span>只表示具备命中可能；本轮仍要逐个通过 construction、semantics、compact 与 graph guards。</span></article>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-grid" style="margin-top:18px">
        <article class="trust-card"><b>执行位置</b><span>Target graph replay 可能已经执行 epilogue 的 scatter/greedy accept；这些 device 操作写入静态 buffer。</span></article>
        <article class="trust-card" data-kind="guard"><b>采用条件</b><span>只有 <code>folded_accept=true</code> 才读取这些接受结果。否则应用 grammar/logit 调整后走 06；<code>inject_gate=0</code> 阻止有效融合提交。</span></article>
      </div>
      <a class="topic-link" data-nav href="dspark-folded-capture-replay.html"><b>08A · warm-up、capture、begin_step 与 replay 到底按什么顺序发生？</b><span>用 Python/CPU、CUDA stream 与静态 buffer 三条泳道逐轮展开。</span></a>
      <details class="source-details"><summary>为什么 / 如果省略 / 易错边界 / 源码锚点</summary><div class="source-details__body">
        <div class="callouts"><div class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>COMPACT、CUDA Graph、folded 是三个维度</b><p>compact 可以 eager；graph 命中也不自动让 accept folded；folded 还要求输出语义不依赖 graph 外调整。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>如果省略语义 guard</b><p>会采用尚未应用 grammar/penalty/custom processor 的结果，造成错误 token、长度或 KV 提交，而不只是性能变化。</p></div></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_worker_v2.py:195–216, 300–340, 570–659</code><span>epilogue/sampler 装配、<code>fold_eligible</code>、<code>folded_accept</code>、<code>folded_commit</code> 与 fallback。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_draft.py:121–155, 268–336</code><span>Draft sampler 与 <code>proposal.folded</code> 的 all-greedy + graph 条件。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_verify.py:453–655</code><span><code>DsparkVerifyEpilogue</code> 静态 buffers、scatter、greedy accept/finalize、可选融合注入及 <code>read_accept()</code>。</span></div>
      </div></details>
    </section>
    <nav class="pager" aria-label="相邻章节"><a data-nav href="dspark-target-hidden-kv-explainer.html">← 07 · 隐藏状态 / Draft KV / 滚动锚点</a><a data-nav href="dspark-folded-capture-replay.html">08A · 折叠捕获与回放 →</a></nav>
    <footer class="site-footer">证据边界 · 当前源码静态核验 · 折叠尾处理器主例仅 NVIDIA CUDA · 未执行 GPU/CUDA Graph runtime replay。</footer>
  </main>
</body>
